".claude/rules/observability.md": [
46,
"- 2026-09-24: `obs_event!` expands to `::tracing::event!`, so a raw-log census greps `tracing::(info|warn|error|debug|trace)!` — a bare `tracing::` grep reads the sanctioned macro in `viola_core::obs` as a raw call.",
47
],
".claude/rules/testing.md": [
121,
"- 2026-11-18: When a change makes the product write into a user-level config (the Claude config's trust record), every existing test that starts the product moves under a test-owned user home in the same chunk, not only the new cases: an old test that inherits the runner's `HOME` would lock, read and write the operator's real config.",
122
],
".claude/rules/verification-harness.md": [
74,
"- 2026-11-17: A change to what the fake agent draws under `--screens` reaches `cli_verify`'s `viola verify --record` recorded-screen cases, which select by the stamped verify run rather than by the file touched, so a plan changing the fake's screens puts `cli_verify` in its gate block.",
75
]
},
